<title>CANADA: RESAERCH ALERT - Glamis Gold raised.</title>
<headline>RESAERCH ALERT - Glamis Gold raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised its rating on Glamis Gold Ltd to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
